  m_Name: Carta_BemViver
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Bem Viver
  _titleEn: Good Living
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "A cidade mede o sucesso pela vida em comunidade e pela natureza preservada,
    n\xE3o pelo crescimento, e deixa em segundo plano a corrida por inova\xE7\xE3o."
  _summaryEn: The city measures success by community life and preserved nature rather
    than growth, and puts the race for innovation second.
  _realWorld: "A Constitui\xE7\xE3o do Equador, de 2008, fala em alcan\xE7ar o buen
    vivir, o sumak kawsay, em harmonia com a natureza, e a da Bol\xEDvia, de 2009,
    p\xF5e o viver bem entre os seus princ\xEDpios."
  _realWorldEn: Ecuador's 2008 Constitution speaks of reaching buen vivir, sumak
    kawsay, in harmony with nature, and Bolivia's 2009 Constitution lists living
    well among its principles.
  _tradeOffs: "Os dois pa\xEDses seguiram pagando programas sociais com a exporta\xE7\xE3o
    de petr\xF3leo, g\xE1s e min\xE9rios, o que mostra a dist\xE2ncia entre o princ\xEDpio
    escrito e a economia real."
  _tradeOffsEn: Both countries kept funding social programs with oil, gas and mineral
    exports, which shows the gap between the written principle and the real economy.
  _sources:
  - Label: Buen vivir (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buen_vivir
  - Label: Sumak kawsay (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sumak_kawsay
